0..37 Comment "//! Products and records satisfy eta."
38..41 Comment "//!"
42..88 Comment "//! A pair equals the pair of its projections."
89..134 Comment "//! A record equals the record of its fields."
135..203 Comment "//! The unit is the tuple of no components, and it equals each value"
204..220 Comment "//! of its type."
221..224 Comment "//!"
225..294 Comment "//! A neutral product converts to its projected tuple on either side."
295..337 Comment "//! Reflexivity proves the resulting path."
338..417 Comment "//! Eta reads no grade, so a linear parameter of the unit type stays used once."
418..421 Comment "//!"
422..478 Comment "//! - cites: [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]"
479..482 Comment "//!"
483..655 Comment "//! [MartinLof-1984-intuitionistic_type_theory]: https://archive-pml.github.io/martin-lof/pdfs/Bibliopolis-Book-retypeset-1984.pdf \"Martin-Löf, Intuitionistic Type Theory\""
